1
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,310
you stop?

2
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:21,800
Dreaming on!

3
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:29,270
Whoa!

4
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:34,873
Are you all right, sir?

5
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:36,640
How did they capture you?

6
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,200
I was stupid.

7
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,501
All this time I trusted Kyoshiro,

8
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:44,005
but he stabbed me in the back.

9
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:50,520
Anyway, what the hell
happened to the tree?

10
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:51,960
Big Mom!

11
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,757
She started throwing a
fit back in the dome!

12
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:57,428
And her attack made it
all the way out here?

13
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,800
Well, that's terrifying.

14
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,960
Though she did help me escape.

15
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:08,920
After all these years, I can't believe
Kyoshiro was one of Odin's retainers.

16
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:15,200
I don't give a damn about
Wano's history or its future.

17
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:18,840
Anyone who betrays me will pay.

18
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,510
Shorts!

19
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:36,340
Yugarra won't take another step!

20
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,597
They're not as tough as they look.

21
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,510
Butcher them!

22
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:52,417
We will not submit.

23
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:55,200
Not to you, Karoo, or anyone else!

24
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:57,340
Bring it on.

25
00:03:25,380 --> 00:03:28,640
Now, we will take care
of the rest. Not yet.

26
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:31,480
Forget about us.

27
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:34,980
Dog, cat!

28
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:38,740
I think we deserve a turn first.

29
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,350
That's right.

30
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:52,997
Oh, my

31
00:03:53,080 --> 00:04:00,080
god.

32
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,774
Come on, they're fast.

33
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:25,759
Yaaaaaaaaaahhhhhh!

34
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:46,160
It's more than just the
Straw Hats down there.

35
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:50,100
Those are definitely prisoners
from Udon, my prisoners.

36
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:52,580
Even Hyogro's here.

37
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:55,908
Step away for a second,
it all goes to hell.

38
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:58,162
What happened at the labor camp?

39
00:04:58,340 --> 00:05:00,940
Baba Nico wouldn't betray me, right?

40
00:05:01,380 --> 00:05:02,851
This is the Chief Warden.

41
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:04,980
It seems we finally got through.

42
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:08,337
All of our enemies are
sitting quietly behind bars.

43
00:05:08,420 --> 00:05:12,177
That includes Straw Hat, Luffy,
Captain Kidd, and all the other rebels.

44
00:05:12,260 --> 00:05:15,025
I just called to let you
know that all is well.

45
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,160
It just doesn't add up.

46
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:24,297
Don't worry, I won't blame you for this.

47
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:26,237
I know who you are after all.

48
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,417
You're an idiot.

49
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:30,837
You were doing so well
till you hit the last part.

50
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:35,417
Your antics aside, we need to
settle this situation immediately.

51
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:37,457
Whatever—stop bossing me around!

52
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:38,370
Hey

53
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,597
Straw Hat—eat shit!

54
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:46,637
The island is in chaos from top to bottom.

55
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:52,637
Hawkins, you only joined the beast pirates
because the situation forced you to.

56
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:55,037
Now's your chance for revenge.

57
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:57,317
You're telling me to betray Kaido.

58
00:05:57,400 --> 00:06:00,157
Don't take me for a fool.

59
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:06,137
One percent—what have you
been trying so hard to protect

60
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:10,317
the probability that a certain
man survives the night?

61
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:12,877
Just one percent—I pity him.

62
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,780
Can you hear me,

63
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,177
Toby Rope? I'm busy.

64
00:06:21,260 --> 00:06:22,500
What do

65
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:26,917
you want, king?

66
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,417
I'm sure you're aware of
the current situation.

67
00:06:29,500 --> 00:06:32,197
It doesn't reflect well on us.

68
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:35,557
We're gathered today
for the fire festival,

69
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:39,517
but even with all our forces here we
still allow the samurai to invade.

70
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:44,877
This is without a doubt the biggest
error in Onigashima's history.

71
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,920
We must put aside

72
00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:52,117
our internal strife even if Kaido
was the one who encouraged it.

73
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,360
I don't get it.

74
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,457
I'm referring to the
promise he made right now.

75
00:06:56,540 --> 00:06:59,957
I'm sure you're searching for
young master Yamato hoping to earn

76
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:03,517
the right to challenge one of the
lead performers for their position.

77
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:09,937
I was looking forward to it myself,
but we must postpone that for now.

78
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:12,957
What you cheater—you had no choice.

79
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,257
Look around, sis—it's madness.

80
00:07:14,340 --> 00:07:15,737
Oh, Pei—Pei!

81
00:07:15,820 --> 00:07:19,457
I was hoping you'd pop up.

82
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:24,597
Yamato climbed over a wall and got away,
so I need you to carry me on your back now.

83
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,510
How dare you shut up!

84
00:07:25,593 --> 00:07:29,480
back now how dare you
shut up You stupid brats.

85
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:32,100
Who are you calling the brats?

86
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:34,397
Don't bump me together
without the odds of a joke.

87
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:36,421
Kaido is fighting on the rooftop.

88
00:07:37,060 --> 00:07:40,825
Right now, the enemy is trying
to reach the top from the inside.

89
00:07:41,860 --> 00:07:42,800
Move quickly.

90
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,904
Stop them dead in their tracks.

91
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:47,560
We have 30,000 troops.

92
00:07:47,940 --> 00:07:49,600
They only have 5,000.

93
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:52,172
We should be able to overwhelm the enemy.

94
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:55,419
But that doesn't mean you
should underestimate them.

95
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,400
Good luck.

96
00:08:02,900 --> 00:08:03,820
Hey Drake.

97
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:06,537
We can take advantage of this mess.

98
00:08:06,620 --> 00:08:07,937
Come with me.

99
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:10,997
I got a plan, but I can't do it alone.

100
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:13,220
You care to elaborate first?

101
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:15,660
I have somebody that I want to kill.

102
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:18,137
We're taking out Queen.

103
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:21,037
Don't get me involved in
your petty little rivalry.

104
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:23,397
We can't afford to diminish our forces.

105
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:25,537
We'll be much better off without him.

106
00:08:25,620 --> 00:08:27,560
I don't know about this.

107
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:32,000
Don't worry, Sir Luffy!

108
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,900
Keep aiming for the top!

109
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:36,560
Our men will clear the way for you! Yeah!

110
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,260
So save your strength!

111
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:40,601
You're gonna need it soon enough!

112
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:49,690
Forward!

113
00:08:49,773 --> 00:08:53,160
Open up a path for the Straw Hat Dream!

114
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:12,280
We're not losing to criminal scum!

115
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,040
This is certainly chaotic.

116
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,217
We gotta kick that big boy out of the way!

117
00:09:26,300 --> 00:09:29,006
It's hard to believe
such a thing even exists.

118
00:09:29,220 --> 00:09:30,455
Don't be intimidated!

119
00:09:30,860 --> 00:09:31,801
Attack its feet!

120
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:33,646
We'll bring it to the ground!

121
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:09,900
Don't worry, I've got you there.

122
00:10:10,380 --> 00:10:11,620
It's Jimmy!

123
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,080
Bring it!

124
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,140
Come on!

125
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:45,520
All right, fleabags.

126
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:47,060
You've had enough fun.

127
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:53,230
Kaido.

128
00:10:53,313 --> 00:10:56,200
Jack is one of our lead performers.

129
00:10:56,620 --> 00:10:58,520
I handpicked him myself.

130
00:10:59,020 --> 00:11:01,557
You really think I'm gonna sit back and

131
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:05,280
watch one of my most
valued men get butchered?

132
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,100
I failed your command.

133
00:11:07,940 --> 00:11:10,100
I have no excuse.

134
00:11:11,100 --> 00:11:12,100
Take heart, Jack.

135
00:11:12,300 --> 00:11:14,418
You didn't lose because you're weak.

136
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,640
They're just strong.

137
00:11:21,020 --> 00:11:22,100
Overwhelmingly so.

138
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:34,160
Their Suolong power has caused our crew
grievous losses, but look at them now.

139
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:37,493
Look at how many minks you've destroyed.

140
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,940
Get yourself patched up.

141
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,718
You've done enough.

142
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:46,200
What the hell is going on here?

143
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:49,880
You know what you did, so
why don't you tell the class?

144
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:59,377
For one back in the capital, you
let Trafalgar law escape a guard!

145
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:01,137
Overheard you—I'm not surprised.

146
00:12:01,220 --> 00:12:03,377
It was you, but I can't
determine your goal.

147
00:12:03,460 --> 00:12:06,957
It seems so pointless—I get it now.

148
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:10,437
So when you said you wanted to kill
somebody, it was obviously you.

149
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:14,837
A shame that one of our
head officers was a rat!

150
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:15,750
a rat

151
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:18,217
Surely you can't be working alone.

152
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:20,357
You must be feeding intel to someone.

153
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,457
What's your mission?

154
00:12:21,540 --> 00:12:23,280
Who are you really?

155
00:12:26,980 --> 00:12:27,820
It's over.

156
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:30,242
I can't talk my way out of this.

157
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,200
Kill me if you want to.

158
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:36,880
But I will never tell
you bastards the truth.

159
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,820
I won't kill you.

160
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:42,980
Why would I do that when I
could torture you instead?

161
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:50,520
Oh, the fun we'll have together, Drake.

162
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,900
He's not so big.

163
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,460
What are you doing?

164
00:12:57,820 --> 00:13:00,060
He's as big and mean as Orz.

165
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,820
That fight wasn't easy.

166
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:05,780
In fact, it took all our power
combined to knock him out.

167
00:13:08,300 --> 00:13:10,020
Not this time!

168
00:13:10,620 --> 00:13:11,840
Lock me!

169
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:13,660
Lock me!

170
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,280
Loopy!

171
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,340
Wa-choo!

172
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,660
Boy here!

173
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,120
Fountain Man!

174
00:13:32,460 --> 00:13:34,600
Oh, that bower!

175
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:37,720
He looks just like the
God of Fire himself!

176
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:42,080
Wa-choo!

177
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:57,340
All right, fine.

178
00:13:58,580 --> 00:14:00,857
Aw, here I was hoping
you'd put up a fight.

179
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:02,460
It's more fun that way.

180
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,860
Here you go. Huh?

181
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:07,900
Consider this a parting gift.

182
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:09,740
Bye-bye.

183
00:14:12,340 --> 00:14:13,580
Aw, shit.

184
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:22,040
Fine. But now what?

185
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:24,209
Can't go back to the Navy.

186
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:26,290
No.

187
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:27,834
Figure that out later.

188
00:14:32,500 --> 00:14:34,020
I can't give up.

189
00:14:34,420 --> 00:14:35,780
There's still hope.

190
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:40,180
No! Stop! Stop!

191
00:14:42,180 --> 00:14:44,620
Get out of my way! Gecko!

192
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:14,630
Whoa!

193
00:15:27,540 --> 00:15:28,700
Hold on!

194
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:30,685
It's Drake from the Toby Robo!

195
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,901
Why's that guy helping out Luffy?

196
00:15:37,220 --> 00:15:38,500
Don't give up.

197
00:15:39,940 --> 00:15:40,960
Not yet.

198
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:53,360
I'm telling you, Luffy's the best.

199
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:58,380
Strahag Luffy, I can't explain
now, but I am an army of one!

200
00:16:00,280 --> 00:16:01,300
Let me help!

201
00:16:01,620 --> 00:16:03,280
Let me fight beside you!

202
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:04,540
I'm not your enemy!

203
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:27,977
seems kind of suspect why the sudden
change of heart huh not to mention

204
00:16:28,060 --> 00:16:32,177
this guy's a perv this creep spied
on nami and robin taking a bath

205
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:36,537
back in the flower capital wait
what happened looks like he became

206
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:40,780
half dinosaur seems to be a signature
power among the toby Rope Oh,

207
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:44,280
but something isn't right.

208
00:16:45,260 --> 00:16:47,320
Has he lost his frickin' mind?

209
00:16:47,780 --> 00:16:49,380
Hey, Drake, what gives?

210
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,838
Why'd you attack one of the numbers?

211
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,600
I'm telling you, Luffy's the best.

212
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:58,099
I don't exactly know how to put it.

213
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:01,897
It's like, if he's your friend, he
feels closer than anything in the world.

214
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:04,237
But if he's your enemy,
he's totally out of reach.

215
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:05,732
He's more than a pirate.

216
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:07,586
There's no one else like him.

217
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:09,657
What does that even mean?

218
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:11,681
There's just something about him.

219
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:14,252
He has this power that draws everyone in.

220
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:20,000
I think I know you.

221
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:22,437
Why do you want to take down Kaido?

222
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:26,260
I can't tell you why, but I
assure you, our goals align.

223
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:37,117
Whatever you want from us, we're too
late in the game to deal with this crap.

224
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,100
Luffy!

225
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:40,937
You know what he's done, right?

226
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:43,780
This guy is Kaido's
lackey, just like Hawkins.

227
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:48,140
Listen, I left that position
and they want me dead.

228
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:51,420
Oh, so now you want our protection?

229
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:55,160
I don't want backstabbers
anywhere near my captain.

230
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:58,840
Luffy doesn't need your
help, so stay away.

231
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:03,120
Even among fellow pirates,
there's still a code of honor.

232
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:29,120
Okay, Drake, you can help.

233
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:30,360
Luffy, no!

234
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:33,993
I know you're the captain,
but stay the hell out of this!

235
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:42,480
You must get to the roof,
Luffy. Now hurry! Thanks, guys.

236
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:43,820
I'm on it.

237
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:50,020
Hey, Sanji, let's make
it to the big battle.

238
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:51,750
Yeah.

239
00:18:51,833 --> 00:18:54,617
I think I figured out who's in charge
of all the samurai and pirates.

240
00:18:54,700 --> 00:18:56,677
It's that Straw Hat guy from before.

241
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:57,878
Let's go after him.

242
00:18:58,680 --> 00:18:59,960
Let's help Straw Hat.

243
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:02,315
Do whatever you can to hold them back.

244
00:19:02,980 --> 00:19:05,597
Get out of our way if you
know what's good for you.

245
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:08,580
I'm gonna smash you ultra-idiots flat!

246
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:26,077
I know those two jerks!

247
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:27,397
I fucked them earlier!

248
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:29,080
Wait a sec...

249
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:37,040
That's the dinosaur guy from the capital.

250
00:19:37,740 --> 00:19:42,320
Hold on, who's that ultra
cutie there with him?

251
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:48,500
I'll see to it you don't
get anywhere near, Kaido.

252
00:19:49,020 --> 00:19:51,260
This ends now, straw man!

253
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:53,340
Special attack, Green Star, go!

254
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:59,680
Wait for it!

255
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:01,040
Skullbomb grass!

256
00:20:08,380 --> 00:20:09,260
Papa!

257
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:16,800
There, answer me!

258
00:20:20,080 --> 00:20:21,977
It's me, Nami!

259
00:20:22,060 --> 00:20:24,240
What the hell is wrong with you?

260
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:27,500
There's nothing I love
more than stomping lizards!

261
00:20:27,700 --> 00:20:29,580
Okay, I hope you're ready!

262
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:32,300
Cut that out, you idiot!

263
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:35,440
Did you call me a lizard?

264
00:20:37,080 --> 00:20:41,017
Stay where you are, unless you want
to be doused and wrecked aside!

265
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:42,420
Don't hide behind me!

266
00:20:43,520 --> 00:20:45,520
How dare you shoot me?

267
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:48,640
Which one of you did it? Vice up!

268
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:50,980
Over here, Papa!

269
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:53,041
It was that scrawny little tramp!

270
00:20:53,500 --> 00:20:54,330
She's right!

271
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:56,000
You've met your match!

272
00:20:56,100 --> 00:20:58,297
For I am the Great Lizard Buster Nami!

273
00:20:58,380 --> 00:20:59,792
Better remember my name!

274
00:21:00,020 --> 00:21:01,500
I told you enough!

275
00:21:03,300 --> 00:21:04,920
That wasn't me talking!

276
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:06,474
But it doesn't matter!

277
00:21:06,620 --> 00:21:08,855
We're already knee-deep in this fight!

278
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:10,630
Fine.

279
00:21:11,780 --> 00:21:12,860
I'm not scared!

280
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:14,677
Show me the worst you can do!

281
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:15,590
Huh?

282
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:22,417
You know your words don't
match your actions at all!

283
00:21:22,500 --> 00:21:23,900
Like your one to talk!

284
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:26,240
I won't let you get away!

285
00:21:26,340 --> 00:21:28,137
You're in a deep for hurting Papa!

286
00:21:28,220 --> 00:21:29,279
We're out of here!

287
00:21:29,420 --> 00:21:30,250
Yeah, goodbye!

288
00:21:30,500 --> 00:21:32,160
You'll never take us alive!

289
00:21:33,360 --> 00:21:34,480
Stop coming!

290
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:42,140
Way to go, Usopp!

291
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,892
You better protect Nami!

292
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:45,341
Right, let's go.

293
00:21:45,980 --> 00:21:47,397
Kinemon's waiting for us.

294
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:48,310
Yeah!

295
00:21:55,280 --> 00:21:57,580
You've got to cover your ears, Sanji!

296
00:21:58,760 --> 00:22:00,000
Yeah, all right.

297
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:03,960
I'm about to drop some
fighting music. Slash!

298
00:22:11,560 --> 00:22:13,440
Learned from last time, huh?

299
00:22:13,660 --> 00:22:14,720
Aren't you clever?

300
00:22:16,040 --> 00:22:17,480
But you know...

301
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:21,637
You're about to be in for
a bad time you kind of

302
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:25,460
need that sense of hearing
that bye-bye check it out

303
00:22:58,800 --> 00:22:59,630
Chaka!

304
00:23:04,780 --> 00:23:05,610
Kaku!

305
00:23:10,100 --> 00:23:10,930
Chaka!

306
00:23:13,340 --> 00:23:16,937
It's fun to be out to see
you guys like this right now!

307
00:23:17,020 --> 00:23:17,960
Come on.

308
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:20,280
What the hell happened here, man?

309
00:23:20,840 --> 00:23:25,487
There was a time when the dead of your
wrecked cities like it weren't no thang!

310
00:23:29,360 --> 00:23:31,320
This pisses me off!

311
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:35,377
Those weak-sized buzzkills think
they can roll up to our party

312
00:23:35,460 --> 00:23:38,257
and clobber the piss out of you
guys just because you're wasted?!

313
00:23:38,340 --> 00:23:39,811
That's the ultimate diss!

314
00:23:51,220 --> 00:23:53,260
All right, it's time to party.

315
00:23:53,580 --> 00:23:54,480
Hachi!

316
00:23:55,740 --> 00:23:56,840
Hachi!

317
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:02,160
Have you suffered up yet?

318
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,120
Ha-cha-cha-cha!

319
00:24:06,460 --> 00:24:08,140
There's ten of these guys?

320
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:10,400
I gotta score some more cola.

321
00:24:10,740 --> 00:24:13,597
With a name like the
numbers, I should have known.

322
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:15,517
Now, it's a giant, it's time to go.

323
00:24:15,600 --> 00:24:17,857
Show him what happens
when you get in the flow.

324
00:24:20,220 --> 00:24:21,157
Give it up, give it up.

325
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:22,180
Let's get dumb.

326
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:25,700
What the hell?

327
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:27,617
Is he able to command those guys?

328
00:24:27,700 --> 00:24:29,800
He's so annoying. Just ditch him.

329
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:31,431
There's no time for this.

330
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:34,280
You have a point. Let's go. Yeah.

331
00:24:39,340 --> 00:24:41,000
You can check my freestyle.

332
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:42,240
You're in denial.

333
00:24:42,380 --> 00:24:43,210
Yeah, yo.

334
00:24:43,293 --> 00:24:44,737
Hachi gonna make you run eight miles.

335
00:24:44,820 --> 00:24:46,320
I'll give it up, Lopey!

336
00:24:47,060 --> 00:24:48,884
Let's keep ignoring this idiot!

337
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:50,631
Yeah, sounds like a plan!

338
00:24:50,860 --> 00:24:52,080
Ah-cha!

339
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:53,710
Ah-cha!

340
00:24:57,300 --> 00:24:58,130
Ah-cha!

341
00:24:58,480 --> 00:25:00,500
Ah-cha! Ah-cha!

342
00:25:09,760 --> 00:25:11,040
Ah-cha!

343
00:25:11,740 --> 00:25:12,940
Ah-cha-cha!

344
00:25:13,940 --> 00:25:15,480
Ha-cha-cha-cha!

345
00:25:17,260 --> 00:25:19,740
Look at how strong he is! Careful.

346
00:25:20,100 --> 00:25:22,837
If he swings him around,
we're surely done for.

347
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:25,000
Well, this is just great. Hachi!

348
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:26,510
Hachi!

349
00:25:31,900 --> 00:25:32,940
Hachi!

350
00:25:33,860 --> 00:25:34,720
Listen here.

351
00:25:35,040 --> 00:25:38,805
Run straight out of the dome as
fast as your legs will take you.

352
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:41,797
If we allow that giant to run wild,

353
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:44,857
then the samurai won't make
it to the final skirmish.

354
00:25:44,940 --> 00:25:45,880
I'm on it.

355
00:25:46,260 --> 00:25:47,380
Do your best.

356
00:25:47,620 --> 00:25:48,520
Always do.

357
00:25:50,320 --> 00:25:52,760
Acha! Acha! Acha!

358
00:25:53,540 --> 00:25:57,920
General Franky is not your
personal plaything, you big goon.

359
00:25:58,760 --> 00:25:59,980
Acha! Acha!

360
00:26:00,660 --> 00:26:03,020
And good luck trying to catch me.

361
00:26:05,220 --> 00:26:06,280
Acha! Acha!

362
00:26:07,120 --> 00:26:07,950
Oh, damn.

363
00:26:08,060 --> 00:26:09,457
No respect, I tell you.

364
00:26:09,540 --> 00:26:12,360
I'll show him I've got some dumb toy!

365
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,740
At least hear me out!

366
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:19,734
I have a lot to gain from your victory!

367
00:26:20,080 --> 00:26:21,500
My life depends on it!

368
00:26:23,060 --> 00:26:24,800
How can I convince you?

369
00:26:31,380 --> 00:26:35,040
I gotta admit, you seem
like an honest guy.

370
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,070
But...

371
00:26:39,960 --> 00:26:43,377
There won't be an alliance till
I figure out what makes you tick.

372
00:26:43,460 --> 00:26:46,820
Who are you, what do you
want, and who do you work for?

373
00:26:53,080 --> 00:26:54,120
Rise up!

374
00:26:54,300 --> 00:26:55,697
Bring the party to the scene!

375
00:26:55,780 --> 00:26:58,133
Crankin' number's gonna make you scream!

376
00:26:58,360 --> 00:27:00,600
Come on out! Yoo-hoo!

377
00:27:01,320 --> 00:27:02,820
I need your help!

378
00:27:03,020 --> 00:27:04,240
You sobered up yet?

379
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:10,460
You better knock that shit off.

380
00:27:13,940 --> 00:27:17,680
I heard some interesting
rumors about you homie.

381
00:27:18,580 --> 00:27:20,617
Let me guess, you're out of options,

382
00:27:20,700 --> 00:27:23,759
so you're leeching off that
weak little pirate crew.

383
00:27:25,060 --> 00:27:29,917
I never liked you, Apu; I've been
waiting for an excuse to kick your ass.

384
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:33,294
This isn't a favor for Straw
Head; I just hate that guy.

385
00:27:33,800 --> 00:27:36,094
We've got one thing in common at least.

386
00:27:36,620 --> 00:27:39,600
I've got a score to settle
with this clown myself.

387
00:27:42,220 --> 00:27:43,660
Fine, I give in.

388
00:27:44,140 --> 00:27:45,400
It's an alliance.

389
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:47,160
What did you say?

390
00:28:06,800 --> 00:28:07,840
Oh, Dark!

391
00:28:14,140 --> 00:28:18,900
Now I got you right where I
want you, you traitorous turd.

392
00:28:19,120 --> 00:28:21,380
But you're more than a traitor.

393
00:28:21,760 --> 00:28:23,000
You're a spy.

394
00:28:24,460 --> 00:28:25,900
You're pretty popular.

395
00:28:26,120 --> 00:28:28,238
Sure you want to team up with Luffy?

396
00:28:28,520 --> 00:28:31,657
I never wanted them as friends, so
I'm happy to have them as enemies.

397
00:28:31,740 --> 00:28:34,140
It's all over! Hey!

398
00:28:34,340 --> 00:28:36,600
You gotta stay with me! I'm trying!

399
00:28:36,860 --> 00:28:37,900
It's too much!

400
00:28:38,080 --> 00:28:39,860
Just leave me! You'll be fine!

401
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:42,400
It's not bad! You're wrong!

402
00:28:43,820 --> 00:28:45,020
It burns!

403
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:09,220
This isn't good.

404
00:29:11,100 --> 00:29:12,717
I know these bots.

405
00:29:12,800 --> 00:29:14,440
We're in trouble.

406
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:38,720
Let's see how long you can
survive my attacks, shall we?

407
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:45,860
One shot and you're dead,
so I'll start running.

408
00:29:50,980 --> 00:29:53,757
The thought of escape
never occurred to me.

409
00:29:53,840 --> 00:29:55,580
Black friend!

410
00:29:57,420 --> 00:29:59,880
Black fire style!

411
00:30:03,500 --> 00:30:05,540
Black friend!

412
00:30:10,380 --> 00:30:11,780
Black!

413
00:30:34,340 --> 00:30:35,880
You thought we'd run?

414
00:30:36,840 --> 00:30:38,800
What do you take us for?

415
00:30:39,180 --> 00:30:40,220
No more.

416
00:30:40,460 --> 00:30:41,580
We're done fleeing.

417
00:30:42,020 --> 00:30:43,800
The time to fight is now.

418
00:30:44,320 --> 00:30:49,660
We stand here as Lord Odin's samurai
and we shall proudly die as such.

419
00:30:51,560 --> 00:30:54,360
After relieving you of your head, that is!
